{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long gcd_ex(long long a, long long b) {\n    if (a < b) swap(a, b);\n    while (b != 0) {\n        long long r = a % b;\n        a = b;\n        b = r;\n    }\n    return a;\n}\n\nlong long lcm_ex(long long a, long long b) {\n    return a / gcd_ex(a, b) * b;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    \n    long long x, y, n;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n    \n    if (y <= n) {\n        long long g = gcd_ex(x, y);\n        for (; g > 1; g = gcd_ex(x, y)) {\n            x /= g;\n            y /= g;\n        }\n        cout << x << \"/\" << y;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    long long best_n = 0, best_d = 1;\n    long double min_delta = numeric_limits<long double>::max();\n    \n    for (long long d = 1; d <= n; ++d) {\n        long long L = lcm_ex(d, y);\n        long long T = x * (L / y);\n        long long step = L / d;\n        \n        long long candidate1 = T / step;\n        long long v1 = candidate1 * step;\n        long double diff1 = fabsl((long double)T - v1) / L;\n        \n        if (diff1 < min_delta) {\n            min_delta = diff1;\n            best_n = candidate1;\n            best_d = d;\n        }\n        \n        long long candidate2 = (T + step - 1) / step;\n        long long v2 = candidate2 * step;\n        long double diff2 = fabsl((long double)T - v2) / L;\n        \n        if (diff2 < min_delta) {\n            min_delta = diff2;\n            best_n = candidate2;\n            best_d = d;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    long long g = gcd_ex(best_n, best_d);\n    best_n /= g;\n    best_d /= g;\n    \n    cout << best_n << \"/\" << best_d;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.math.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static long gcd_ex(long a, long b) {\n        if (a < b) {\n            long temp = a;\n            a = b;\n            b = temp;\n        }\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long r = a % b;\n            a = b;\n            b = r;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    public static long lcm_ex(long a, long b) {\n        return a / gcd_ex(a, b) * b;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        \n        long x = scanner.nextLong();\n        long y = scanner.nextLong();\n        long n = scanner.nextLong();\n        \n        if (y <= n) {\n            long g = gcd_ex(x, y);\n            while (g > 1) {\n                x /= g;\n                y /= g;\n                g = gcd_ex(x, y);\n            }\n            System.out.println(x + \"/\" + y);\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        long best_n = 0;\n        long best_d = 1;\n        double min_delta = Double.MAX_VALUE;\n        \n        for (long d = 1; d <= n; ++d) {\n            long L = lcm_ex(d, y);\n            long T = x * (L / y);\n            long step = L / d;\n            \n            long candidate1 = T / step;\n            long v1 = candidate1 * step;\n            double diff1 = Math.abs((double)T - v1) / (double)L;\n            \n            if (diff1 < min_delta) {\n                min_delta = diff1;\n                best_n = candidate1;\n                best_d = d;\n            }\n            \n            long candidate2 = (T + step - 1) / step;\n            long v2 = candidate2 * step;\n            double diff2 = Math.abs((double)T - v2) / (double)L;\n            \n            if (diff2 < min_delta) {\n                min_delta = diff2;\n                best_n = candidate2;\n                best_d = d;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long g = gcd_ex(best_n, best_d);\n        best_n /= g;\n        best_d /= g;\n        \n        System.out.println(best_n + \"/\" + best_d);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0002233732520835474, -2.145764938177308e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00012885693286079913, -6.9141146923357155e-06, -0.16554208099842072, -0.5850446224212646, -6.48477507638745e-05, -6.186770770000294e-05, -0.39653560519218445, -0.5193198919296265, -1.9192511899746023e-05, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -2.2291887944447808e-05, -0.007606707978993654, -0.008617713116109371, -0.3900139629840851, -5.245195097813848e-06, -0.1191360205411911, -2.4437606043647975e-05, -0.002550446195527911, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -6.735097849741578e-05, -2.9682672902708873e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.3378546504536644e-06, 0.0, -1.311301275563892e-06, 0.0, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -7.629365427419543e-06, -0.00013267113536130637, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.7418097943154862e-06, 0.0, -4.172238186583854e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.192092